"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4617399519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119993#issuecomment-4617399519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119993","id":4617399519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEzfs3w","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T22:58:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T22:58:37Z","body":"Looks like betsy setup has dither commented out. \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/20b44c9575f3d638d1861813003768155fb0fe9a/modules/betsy/image_compress_betsy.cpp#L154-L159\n\nReplaced etcpak with stb_dxt for bc1 and it does look better (probably slower; didn't measure). Not surprising as betsy's BC* compression is based on stb_dxt:\n\n_stb_dxt using STB_DXT_NORMAL_\n<img width=\"1145\" height=\"647\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1868799c-f04b-4cad-ad38-d1d291e54e34\" />\n\nTest code here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...mooflu:godot:cpu-texture-compress-119993","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4617399519/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620552204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119993#issuecomment-4620552204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119993","id":4620552204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE2gIDA","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T08:51:46Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T08:51:46Z","body":"stb_dxt is indeed slower than etcpak, especially on 2K textures and above. Though it may be an acceptable tradeoff, given the quality is much higher","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4620552204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"la